WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,800
Brother Tie, listen to me

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,320
They keep asking me why you established the school

3
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:05,920
I told you the cause and effect

4
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:10,010
You didn't say you couldn't tell anyone about it when you first entered the school.

5
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:11,010
They bully you for being fat

6
00:00:11,290 --> 00:00:12,450
I'll drive them away to play with you

7
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:14,170
The excluded become us

8
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:15,330
Now they surround you

9
00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:16,890
You feel welcome

10
00:00:18,270 --> 00:00:20,230
You know I went to school because of my fever

11
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:22,200
Why bring up ghost things?

12
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,860
Isn't it because of your vanity?

13
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:28,040
Come out and chase me now

14
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,040
Don’t you just feel that you have done something wrong?

15
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:34,190
Why are you pretending to be wronged by me here?

16
00:00:34,270 --> 00:00:36,350
You were an anomaly when you were born

17
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:38,350
A group of tongues crawling all over the courtyard is an ominous sign

18
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:40,190
If there is no one, you are the only one who will be killed by you.

19
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:43,520
Who taught you this?

20
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:45,760
That's what everyone in charge said about Deng Xing

21
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:48,400
I suddenly felt that it was not you but me who was ridiculous

22
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:49,520
I'm blind

23
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:51,960
Treat dogs as humans starting today

24
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:53,680
The friendship between you and me is broken like this.
